@startuml
[*] --> Idle

Idle : entry / nil
Idle : do / display current time
Idle : exit / waiting for user input

Idle --> PowerSelection : user selects power level
PowerSelection : entry / waiting for user input
PowerSelection : do / choose between full and half power
PowerSelection : exit / selected power level

PowerSelection --> TimeSetting : selected power level

TimeSetting : entry / selected power level
TimeSetting : do / enter cooking time
TimeSetting : exit / cooking time set

TimeSetting --> Cooking : cooking time set

Cooking : entry / cooking time set
Cooking : do / microwave operation
Cooking --> DoorOpen : door opens during operation

DoorOpen : entry / cooking
DoorOpen : do / stop immediately
DoorOpen --> Idle : door closed or user cancels

Cooking --> Cancel : user cancels cooking process
Cancel : entry / cooking
Cancel : do / cancel the process
Cancel --> Idle : cancelled

Idle --> [*]
@enduml
